    <briefdescription>
<para>File-based checkpoint store for incremental ingestion. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Checkpoints are written as simple key=value text files under the configured directory, one file per source. The store is fully thread-safe.</para>
<para>File name format: <computeroutput>&lt;checkpoint_dir&gt;/&lt;source_id&gt;.checkpoint</computeroutput></para>
<para>Example: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="classthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_checkpoint_store_1a44703aa19596fc6d7600e5c920e7d92c" kindref="member">CheckpointStore</ref><sp/>store(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;/var/lib/themis/checkpoints&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">IngestionCheckpoint<sp/>cp;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">if</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>(store.read(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;hf_legal&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,<sp/>cp))<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>std::cout<sp/>&lt;&lt;<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;Resuming<sp/>from<sp/>doc<sp/>&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>&lt;&lt;<sp/>cp.processed_count<sp/>&lt;&lt;<sp/></highlight><highlight class="charliteral">&apos;\n&apos;</highlight><highlight class="normal">;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">store.write({</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;hf_legal&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,<sp/>5000,<sp/>0,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;2026-02-20T16:00:00Z&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">});</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
